    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-Ith3">
        <head xml:id="gom-Ith3-Hd1e98">Caput 3</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ith3-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ith3-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith3-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith3-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith3_2@12-14">Ad confirmandos vos.</quote>
            Propter hoc ipse venire desideraverat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ith3-Dd1e111">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ith3-Hd1e113">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith3-d1e115">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith3-Qd1e117" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith3_6@26-29">Sicut nos quoque vos: ideo.</quote>
            Quia haec annuntiavit, non pro ejus praesentia, consolati sumus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ith3-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ith3-Hd1e124">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith3-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith3-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith3_9@1-3">Quam enim gratiarum,</quote>
            etc. Nihil est enim tam dignum, quod sufficere possit ad compensationem acquisitae salutis gentium.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ith3-Dd1e133">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ith3-Hd1e135">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith3-d1e137">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith3-Qd1e139" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith3_13@5-6">Sine querela.</quote>
            Ne vos de malis conqueramini, vel ita sitis innocentes, ne quis de vobis possit conqueri, et ut sitis etiam.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith3-d1e143">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith3-Qd1e145" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith3_13@7-8">In sanctitate.</quote>
            Id <pb ed="#P" n="0617D"/> est, virtutum consummatione per hoc exsistentes ante Deum, non ad aspectus hominum.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
